<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Ball Fight Bookmarklet</title>
<body style="font-family:sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px;line-height:1.5">
<h2>Ball Fight bookmarklet</h2>
<p>Drag this button to your bookmarks bar:</p>
<p><a id=bm style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:#6cf;color:#000;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;cursor:grab">&#129354; Ball Fight</a></p>
<p>Click it on any webpage. A betting panel appears top right and the balls fight on top of the page. Click the bookmark again to close.</p>
<h3>Betting (bettcoins)</h3>
<ul><li>You start with 100 bettcoins and they are hard to earn. Pick a fighter, pick an amount, hit FIGHT!</li>
<li>If your pick wins you get 1 + 0.7 x (fighters - 1) times your bet back (for example 2.4x with 3 fighters). Losing loses the bet. If you run out you get a small 40 coin bailout.</li>
<li>Spend bettcoins in the Shop to add new fighters with new powers. Each round uses up to 5 of your fighters.</li>
<li>Your coins and fighters are saved in this browser, per website (bookmarklets can't share storage between sites).</li></ul>
<h3>Upgrades</h3>
<p>Open <b>⬆ Upgrades</b> in the panel. Every fighter you own can get HP +10%, Damage +10% and Cooldown -5% per level, up to level 5 each, paid in bettcoins.</p>
<h3>Powers (auto-used by default, or press the keys)</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>G / H</b> Bird: wing dash / statue (turns nearest enemy to stone)</li>
<li><b>F / N</b> Pat: laser eyes / NUKE</li>
<li><b>J / K</b> Smiley: strafing run / bombing run (plane flyover)</li>
<li><b>X</b> Ninja: shuriken storm (150)</li>
<li><b>O</b> Ghost: phase, invulnerable 3s (200)</li>
<li><b>B</b> Dragon: fire breath (300)</li>
<li><b>L</b> Wizard: lightning on every enemy (300)</li>
<li><b>R</b> Robot: repair 35 HP (350)</li>
<li><b>C / V / Z</b> Hunna (200,000): mega blast on every enemy / 5s shield / smash. 300 HP</li></ul>
<li style='list-style:none'></li>
<ul><li><b>E / I / U</b> SONION (100,000): 200 HP. <b>E shoots nuggets where your mouse points (you aim!)</b> / onion tears (freezes everyone) / crispy heal</li></ul>
<ul><li><b>Q / P</b> KSI (75,000): KFC go-buckets you aim with the mouse / heal half health. 150 HP</li>
<li><b>W / Y / T</b> OWNER ball (not for sale, owner only): decree / crown shield / royal heal. 800 HP</li></ul>
<h3>Ranked mode</h3>
<p>Switch to <b>Ranked</b> at the top of the panel. You pick one of your fighters and <b>control it yourself with the keys</b> against 2 random opponents. 1st place: +25 RP and 40 bettcoins. 2nd: +5 RP and 10 bettcoins. 3rd: -15 RP. Ranks: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond, Crystal, Unreal.</p>
<p>The <b>Ladder</b> button is a friends ladder: make a rank card, send it to a friend, and paste theirs to compare. It is not a live online ladder (that needs a server).</p>
<h3>Inventory</h3>
<p>The <b>Inventory</b> button shows every fighter you own and the ones still locked, with HP, upgrades and keys. Pin 2 or more fighters to choose who fights in casual rounds.</p>
<h3>OWNER ball</h3>
<p>Only the player whose ladder name is <b>CHAZ1</b> can select or use the OWNER ball. The name CHAZ1 can only be set while the admin panel is unlocked. Every time the OWNER ball wins a fight it earns you 50 RP (ranked points), in casual and ranked.</p>
<h3>Gifting</h3>
<p>Open <b>🎁 Gift</b> in the panel. Pick fighters (their upgrades go with them) and/or bettcoins and press Create code. Send the code to a friend, who pastes it in the same Gift section and presses Redeem. Gifts are taken from you, except the owner's gifts which are free. Only the owner can gift the OWNER ball.</p>
<h3>Credits</h3>
<ul><li><b>Lochie</b>: concept</li><li><b>Hunna</b>: ball idea</li><li><b>Chaz</b>: created the game</li></ul>
<h3>Admin panel</h3>
<p>Click the <b>Admin</b> button in the panel and enter the password to add bettcoins, give fighters, change game speed, or reset progress.</p>
